1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,222
Just Some Fries.

2
00:00:02,899 --> 00:00:09,195
A sleepy island. A cafe. One fry nobody notices... and one very hungry seagull.

3
00:00:20,279 --> 00:00:25,087
Dive. Lock on. When the world slows down, find the rhythm.

4
00:00:25,779 --> 00:00:28,115
Steal one. Then the next.

5
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:38,428
Hold Tab. The island shows you everything worth stealing.

6
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:41,271
Dive. Grab. Don't stop.

7
00:00:58,879 --> 00:01:04,287
Coffee. A cocktail. Ice cream. All three... and nothing can catch you.

8
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:12,656
Then go higher. The moon. The sun.

9
00:01:26,056 --> 00:01:28,128
Fish. Why not.

10
00:01:32,056 --> 00:01:35,736
Hat. Shades. Chain. The whole sky.

11
00:01:44,456 --> 00:01:46,912
You came here for some fries... right?

